# iCloud shadow-file guard — repo lives in iCloud Drive, which silently creates
# "* 2.ts" / "* 2.tsx" duplicate files that fool grep-based audits.
**/* 2.ts
**/* 2.tsx
coverage-comms/
**/* 2.md
# Agent E: reference/ commits PNGs, and iCloud duplicated an image whose copy
# still held the UNREDACTED Close capture (real client PII). Ignore image dupes
# so a resurrected copy can never be staged.
**/* 2.png
**/* 2.jpg
**/* 2.jpeg
**/* 2.webp
# M2: iCloud also duplicated a shell script, which the extension list above did
# not cover and which git therefore offered up for staging.
**/* 2.sh
**/* 2.json
**/* 2.css
**/* 2.sql
**/* 2.mjs

# Playwright MCP scratch: page snapshots contain live Close content. Never commit.
.playwright-mcp/
